WEBVTT

00:16.350 --> 00:18.640
<b>This looks darn good.</b>

00:19.220 --> 00:22.890
<b>The fish is in season right now.</b>

00:23.350 --> 00:25.600
<b>What a treat.</b>

00:25.770 --> 00:27.360
<b>Chief.</b>

00:29.230 --> 00:31.780
<b>I'm sorry to disrupt your dinner.</b>

00:31.940 --> 00:34.610
<b>There's a woman named Omasa
who's here to see you.</b>

00:45.580 --> 00:48.130
<b>It's been a long while.</b>

01:02.930 --> 01:05.230
<b>What brings you here?</b>

02:15.630 --> 02:17.510
<b>Blood Battle</b>

02:17.680 --> 02:19.470
<b>This is it.</b>

02:19.640 --> 02:22.510
<b>If I'm going to end up in prison,
I'd have you, Tetsu...</b>

02:22.680 --> 02:23.680
<b>No...</b>

02:23.850 --> 02:27.310
<b>Mr. Hasegawa,
I want you to take care of it.</b>

02:27.480 --> 02:28.810
<b>What do you mean?</b>

02:29.940 --> 02:32.570
<b>It happened a few days ago...</b>

02:36.190 --> 02:38.610
<b>Takedaya</b>

03:06.100 --> 03:07.600
<b>Sister...</b>

03:08.600 --> 03:11.310
<b>Sister... I love you...</b>

03:23.700 --> 03:26.120
<b>Omasa, it's me.</b>

03:54.020 --> 03:56.110
<b>You promised you wouldn't be violent.</b>

04:15.750 --> 04:17.710
<b>How could you?!</b>

04:24.300 --> 04:26.260
<b>I'm so sorry...</b>

04:26.430 --> 04:27.930
<b>It's all my fault...</b>

04:35.850 --> 04:37.770
<b>The next job is a quick one.</b>

04:38.820 --> 04:44.410
<b>We're gonna have you sneak
into the target shop that afternoon.</b>

04:45.610 --> 04:49.240
<b>Are you still bothered
by last week's murder?</b>

04:49.410 --> 04:50.740
<b>But...</b>

04:50.910 --> 04:52.580
<b>Never kill, never rape.</b>

04:52.750 --> 04:55.420
<b>Never steal from the poor, eh?</b>

04:56.790 --> 05:01.170
<b>What's the point in following
such outdated code?</b>

05:01.340 --> 05:04.760
<b>Are you slaughtering them all next time?</b>

05:05.800 --> 05:08.970
<b>I'll contact you within the next five days.</b>

05:10.260 --> 05:12.270
<b>Until then.</b>

05:16.770 --> 05:18.360
<b>Within five days?</b>

05:18.520 --> 05:21.020
<b>There's not much time left.</b>

05:21.190 --> 05:22.900
<b>Where's the target?</b>

05:23.070 --> 05:24.610
<b>I don't know.</b>

05:24.780 --> 05:26.410
<b>When it's a quick job,</b>

05:26.570 --> 05:29.280
<b>all the specifics are given</b>

05:29.450 --> 05:31.950
<b>on the day of execution.
That is Genpachi's way.</b>

05:32.120 --> 05:34.580
<b>Where does he hide?</b>

05:34.750 --> 05:36.710
<b>I have no idea.</b>

05:37.420 --> 05:39.880
<b>Genpachi is a wary man.</b>

05:40.040 --> 05:42.460
<b>Even if one of his men</b>

05:42.630 --> 05:44.130
<b>is captured,</b>

05:44.300 --> 05:47.890
<b>he works things out
so it would never lead to him.</b>

05:50.220 --> 05:53.470
<b>If that's the case,
we don't really have a choice.</b>

05:54.430 --> 05:55.680
<b>Omasa.</b>

05:55.850 --> 05:58.560
<b>You'll have to act as one of them</b>

05:58.730 --> 06:00.610
<b>to infiltrate his clan.</b>

06:01.270 --> 06:04.070
<b>You want me to be the mole?</b>

06:04.230 --> 06:05.240
<b>Can you do it?</b>

06:11.950 --> 06:13.620
<b>We're counting on you.</b>

06:13.790 --> 06:15.250
<b>Yes.</b>

06:19.580 --> 06:20.790
<b>My, my...</b>

06:20.960 --> 06:23.300
<b>What an admirable woman.</b>

06:23.460 --> 06:26.720
<b>What do you think, Sakai and Sajima?</b>

06:29.430 --> 06:32.970
<b>Chief, I don't mean to be rude.</b>

06:33.140 --> 06:35.680
<b>But can we really trust this woman,
Omasa?</b>

06:35.850 --> 06:38.520
<b>How do you know her, chief?</b>

06:39.810 --> 06:42.400
<b>She's just an old friend.</b>

06:43.440 --> 06:45.190
<b>Omasa's father</b>

06:45.360 --> 06:48.780
<b>was a thief with the alias
Chusuke of Tazugane.</b>

06:48.950 --> 06:53.160
<b>He ran a bar which he unashamedly
named "Thief Sake Shop."</b>

06:53.330 --> 06:55.910
<b>That man was a character.</b>

06:56.870 --> 06:59.460
<b>I got along quite well with Chusuke.</b>

06:59.620 --> 07:04.670
<b>I would frequent the Thief Sake Shop
as if I were his relative.</b>

07:04.840 --> 07:06.420
<b>Hey!</b>

07:07.420 --> 07:09.470
<b>Give me some liquor!</b>

07:09.630 --> 07:11.430
<b>Bring me some liquor!</b>

07:12.970 --> 07:14.930
<b>Can't say no to Tetsu.</b>

07:17.720 --> 07:19.850
<b>Jeez, not again!</b>

07:20.020 --> 07:23.860
<b>Omasa was about 10 years old
at the time.</b>

07:24.020 --> 07:28.320
<b>She was a gentle and caring girl.</b>

07:31.360 --> 07:32.700
<b>He's dying out here.</b>

07:32.870 --> 07:35.080
<b>What a sorry sight.</b>

07:35.240 --> 07:37.910
<b>Don't get too close.
He might be carrying a disease.</b>

07:38.080 --> 07:39.370
<b>Lord have mercy...</b>

07:40.410 --> 07:42.750
<b>I'm sure he was up to no good.</b>

07:42.920 --> 07:44.040
<b>That's for sure.</b>

07:44.210 --> 07:47.880
<b>We shouldn't get involved. Let's go.</b>

08:10.990 --> 08:13.990
<b>But that was 20 years ago.
People change.</b>

08:14.160 --> 08:15.490
<b>Even Omasa.</b>

08:15.660 --> 08:17.910
<b>No, I could tell by her eyes.</b>

08:20.080 --> 08:22.830
<b>Will you work for me?</b>

08:23.170 --> 08:24.170
<b>Of course.</b>

08:24.750 --> 08:28.090
<b>That'll make my dead father happy.</b>

08:28.250 --> 08:29.590
<b>Then...</b>

08:29.760 --> 08:34.340
<b>My life is in your hands, Mr. Hasegawa.</b>

08:36.510 --> 08:39.810
<b>She's still the Omasa I remember.</b>

08:52.860 --> 08:55.410
<b>Sister, I love you!</b>

09:13.840 --> 09:16.680
<b>Dinner's completely cold now.</b>

09:17.140 --> 09:18.720
<b>Oh, shoot.</b>

09:18.890 --> 09:20.350
<b>Knowing you,</b>

09:20.510 --> 09:23.770
<b>I'm sure Omasa will never forget about you.</b>

09:23.930 --> 09:26.480
<b>Don't be ridiculous. What are you saying?</b>

09:26.650 --> 09:27.940
<b>Omasa was a young girl,</b>

09:28.110 --> 09:30.690
<b>about 10 years old when I knew her.</b>

09:30.860 --> 09:33.940
<b>That's exactly why she can't forget
about you.</b>

09:34.740 --> 09:37.700
<b>That's the nature of a woman.</b>

09:57.550 --> 09:59.220
<b>Omasa.</b>

10:01.010 --> 10:03.020
<b>Hikojyu?!</b>

10:03.850 --> 10:05.180
<b>I heard from Tetsu...</b>

10:05.350 --> 10:07.270
<b>No, Mr. Hasegawa.</b>

10:07.940 --> 10:09.560
<b>Then, you too?</b>

10:09.730 --> 10:13.730
<b>Yup, I'm an established spy now.</b>

10:14.110 --> 10:18.820
<b>That's right, you also admired
Mr. Hasegawa very much.</b>

10:18.990 --> 10:20.910
<b>Also, eh?</b>

10:21.660 --> 10:23.490
<b>What do you mean?</b>

10:23.660 --> 10:24.700
<b>Nothing.</b>

10:24.870 --> 10:27.540
<b>I was just teasing you.</b>

10:33.250 --> 10:35.510
<b>Get your mussels...</b>

10:35.670 --> 10:38.050
<b>Clams...</b>

10:38.220 --> 10:40.930
<b>It's Genpachi.</b>

10:41.090 --> 10:42.470
<b>Quick, hide in here.</b>

10:42.640 --> 10:44.770
<b>-What?!
-Hurry!</b>

10:49.850 --> 10:51.940
<b>You're here early.</b>

10:52.110 --> 10:53.900
<b>It's happening the day after tomorrow.</b>

10:54.070 --> 10:55.070
<b>Where?</b>

10:55.230 --> 10:57.490
<b>As always, I'll tell you that day.</b>

10:57.650 --> 11:00.360
<b>Using the same guys as last time?</b>

11:00.530 --> 11:02.160
<b>Why do you ask?</b>

11:02.320 --> 11:03.660
<b>You're mistaken.</b>

11:03.830 --> 11:05.990
<b>Remember how it ended last time?</b>

11:06.160 --> 11:09.370
<b>I wanted to make peace
before I worked with them again.</b>

11:09.920 --> 11:12.380
<b>Where are they now?</b>

11:15.750 --> 11:18.880
<b>I'll make sure they know how you feel.</b>

11:19.510 --> 11:21.720
<b>That'll suffice.</b>

11:22.640 --> 11:24.970
<b>Come get your mussels.</b>

11:25.140 --> 11:26.890
<b>Clams!</b>

11:28.390 --> 11:29.390
<b>Is he gone?</b>

11:29.890 --> 11:32.060
<b>Help me out. We're gonna shadow him.</b>

11:32.230 --> 11:33.730
<b>Got it! Let's go!</b>

11:33.900 --> 11:36.820
<b>Whoa!</b>

12:30.330 --> 12:33.580
<b>Doesn't seem like he's gonna
leave this place.</b>

12:33.750 --> 12:37.250
<b>This must be where he hides.</b>

12:37.420 --> 12:38.500
<b>Do me a favor.</b>

12:38.670 --> 12:40.510
<b>Go report this to Mr. Hasegawa.</b>

12:40.670 --> 12:42.170
<b>You got it.</b>

12:42.340 --> 12:44.890
<b>Be careful now, Omasa.</b>

13:18.080 --> 13:19.880
<b>Yes, I'm certain of it.</b>

13:25.510 --> 13:29.850
<b>I was too scared. I couldn't say a word.</b>

13:31.680 --> 13:33.680
<b>I'm very sorry.</b>

13:33.850 --> 13:36.900
<b>No, we appreciate the tip.</b>

13:37.810 --> 13:40.520
<b>But, where could they have gone?</b>

13:41.360 --> 13:42.940
<b>Knowing Omasa,</b>

13:43.110 --> 13:45.530
<b>she could've left us with a clue.</b>

13:54.500 --> 13:56.290
<b>This... is a trail of blood!</b>

13:57.370 --> 13:59.040
<b>Omasa!</b>

14:25.570 --> 14:28.360
<b>Omasa... she's lost a lot of blood!</b>

14:34.410 --> 14:36.910
<b>Does she intend to die...?!</b>

14:47.920 --> 14:50.470
<b>This... must be the place.</b>

14:56.640 --> 14:58.440
<b>There's nobody out here.</b>

14:58.600 --> 14:59.640
<b>Strange.</b>

14:59.810 --> 15:02.690
<b>I thought I sensed someone's presence.</b>

15:06.480 --> 15:08.070
<b>With their spy gone,</b>

15:08.240 --> 15:11.700
<b>the Arson Theft Control might be after us.</b>

15:12.570 --> 15:13.830
<b>Then come out already.</b>

15:14.530 --> 15:17.200
<b>We'll take care of them
with our spears and arrows.</b>

15:28.550 --> 15:30.260
<b>What are we gonna do, Tetsu?!</b>

15:30.430 --> 15:33.470
<b>I'll die in vain facing them alone.</b>

15:33.640 --> 15:34.640
<b>Hikojyu.</b>

15:34.800 --> 15:37.310
<b>Go and gather all of our men here.</b>

15:37.470 --> 15:39.140
<b>Right away.</b>

15:41.020 --> 15:42.230
<b>Hikojyu...</b>

15:42.900 --> 15:45.980
<b>I can't get you involved in this.</b>

15:53.570 --> 15:56.030
<b>I'm coming now, Omasa.</b>

16:05.750 --> 16:08.340
<b>Where are you, Omasa?</b>

16:11.840 --> 16:15.550
<b>She looked surprisingly supple
without her clothes on.</b>

16:16.760 --> 16:22.190
<b>That woman couldn't handle
being tormented by Tatsuno.</b>

16:23.270 --> 16:25.150
<b>I'll go get the boss.</b>

16:25.310 --> 16:29.480
<b>Good, then we'll torture the woman
to death.</b>

16:52.920 --> 16:54.380
<b>Omasa...</b>

16:56.590 --> 16:57.680
<b>What have we here?</b>

16:57.850 --> 17:01.060
<b>Let me entertain you one last time.</b>

17:18.490 --> 17:19.580
<b>Mr. Hasegawa...</b>

17:19.740 --> 17:21.910
<b>You've gone too far...</b>

17:22.660 --> 17:24.910
<b>This is nothing.</b>

17:26.040 --> 17:28.790
<b>I've prepared myself for the worst.</b>

17:29.420 --> 17:31.300
<b>Don't say another word.</b>

17:33.050 --> 17:34.590
<b>You!</b>

17:38.180 --> 17:40.140
<b>What's going on?!</b>

17:41.680 --> 17:42.850
<b>I'll go with you.</b>

17:43.850 --> 17:46.350
<b>Just stay safe right here.</b>

17:47.730 --> 17:48.730
<b>Don't worry.</b>

17:49.810 --> 17:51.770
<b>I'll be right back.</b>

18:24.520 --> 18:27.350
<b>There! He's right above us!</b>

18:59.260 --> 19:01.590
<b>We're this close! Capture him!</b>

19:01.760 --> 19:03.050
<b>Yeah!</b>

19:22.870 --> 19:26.080
<b>Is this... the end?</b>

19:34.000 --> 19:36.210
<b>This is the Arson Theft Control!</b>

19:48.470 --> 19:49.730
<b>Are you all right?</b>

19:49.890 --> 19:51.390
<b>Let's get you treated.</b>

19:51.560 --> 19:54.310
<b>Never mind this scratch.</b>

19:54.480 --> 19:55.980
<b>We need to get Omasa.</b>

19:56.150 --> 19:58.110
<b>She's under the floor over there.</b>

19:58.280 --> 20:01.110
<b>-Get her out now.
-Yes!</b>

20:01.280 --> 20:02.950
<b>Actually... wait!</b>

20:04.070 --> 20:05.160
<b>Hikojyu.</b>

20:05.330 --> 20:06.700
<b>You go.</b>

20:06.870 --> 20:09.080
<b>Bring some clothes with you.</b>

20:09.750 --> 20:11.040
<b>Sure.</b>

20:11.210 --> 20:15.670
<b>Do not let anyone see Omasa
in her present state.</b>

20:17.000 --> 20:19.090
<b>Understood, sir.</b>

20:23.590 --> 20:25.470
<b>Chief.</b>

20:26.220 --> 20:28.010
<b>I can't even get up.</b>

20:28.180 --> 20:30.140
<b>I've aged quite a bit.</b>

20:30.310 --> 20:31.680
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

20:31.850 --> 20:34.980
<b>You still have a lot ahead of you.</b>

20:36.400 --> 20:37.730
<b>You just recruited</b>

20:37.900 --> 20:40.110
<b>a promising spy too.</b>

20:44.360 --> 20:46.410
<b>You're right.</b>

20:51.330 --> 20:54.500
<b>Anyway, is your arm healed now?</b>

20:54.670 --> 20:55.830
<b>Yes.</b>

20:56.000 --> 20:59.340
<b>The doctor said
it wouldn't leave a scar either.</b>

20:59.500 --> 21:01.210
<b>What a relief.</b>

21:01.380 --> 21:05.050
<b>A woman's body can never be scarred.</b>

21:05.220 --> 21:07.390
<b>You'll become a bride someday.</b>

21:10.890 --> 21:13.310
<b>I don't plan to get married.</b>

21:15.020 --> 21:16.520
<b>Since my life</b>

21:16.690 --> 21:19.440
<b>is in your hands, Mr. Hasegawa.</b>

21:19.610 --> 21:22.820
<b>But you can't just live alone like this.</b>

21:23.740 --> 21:27.570
<b>I've already prepared myself
for the worst.</b>

21:29.370 --> 21:30.580
<b>I see.</b>

21:36.420 --> 21:38.580
<b>My lady, I could serve the tea...</b>

21:39.630 --> 21:40.960
<b>Since it got cold,</b>

21:41.130 --> 21:43.340
<b>-I'm preparing it again.
-But...</b>

21:43.880 --> 21:46.430
<b>Come and help me over here.</b>

21:52.600 --> 21:54.480
<b>Look at that, Omasa.</b>

21:55.690 --> 21:58.480
<b>What a beautiful moon.</b>

22:00.060 --> 22:02.110
<b>Indeed.</b>

22:21.130 --> 22:27.300
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.470 --> 22:33.140
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.310 --> 22:39.100
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.440 --> 22:44.860
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.820 --> 22:50.110
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.280 --> 22:54.120
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.290 --> 22:59.170
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:05.130
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.960 --> 23:11.340
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:12.050 --> 23:14.970
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.230 --> 23:23.610
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.980 --> 23:32.990
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:41.670 --> 23:46.670
<b>Chugo Kimura at Arson Theft Control
steps into the Iroha Tea House.</b>

23:47.300 --> 23:50.090
<b>And they find some strange relationship.</b>

23:50.930 --> 23:53.800
<b>Next episode of Onihei
"Yanaka, Iroha Tea House"</b>

23:53.970 --> 23:54.850
<b>Yanaka, Iroha Tea House</b>
